@startuml Feature11_Seq_1
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam minClassWidth 100

title **Feature 11: Kanban Dashboard - Sequence: Load Kanban Board**

actor Recruiter
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "<<controller>>\nApplicationQueryController" as Ctrl
participant "<<service>>\nApplicationQueryService" as Svc
participant "<<repository>>\nApplicationRepository" as Repo
participant "<<dbcontext>>\nAppDbContext" as DbContext
participant "Database" as DB

Recruiter -> UI: Open Kanban Board for Job
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl: GET /api/jobs/{jobId}/board
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: GetBoardByJobAsync(companyId, jobId)
activate Svc

Svc -> Repo: GetBoardByJobAsync(companyId, jobId)
activate Repo
Repo -> DbContext: Query Applications + Candidate info
activate DbContext
DbContext -> DB: SELECT ... JOIN Candidate
activate DB
DB --> DbContext: Rows (grouped by state in UI later)
deactivate DB
DbContext --> Repo: Data
deactivate DbContext
Repo --> Svc: return list of AppBoardRow
deactivate Repo

Svc -> Svc: Map to ApplicationBoardDto\n(List of ApplicationCardDto)

Svc --> Ctrl: return ApplicationBoardDto
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: return JSON
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> Recruiter: Render Kanban columns
deactivate UI
@enduml
